{"id": "34496", "title": "翩翩小龙女", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34496.htm", "intro": "「谁都不准求情，立刻送她到东海牧羊！」 就算海龙王如何疼爱翩翩，在她惹了这么大的麻烦以後，也得狠下决心好好处罚她喽！无奈小丫头天生有闯祸的本事，居然能在东海跟羊群嬉闹聊天，甚至「不小心捡到」奄奄一息的烈问寒，钟情缱绻，期约一年後洞庭湖畔相见。还好小龙女耐不住寂寥，十天就跑出家门，才能勉强接受「天上一日，人间一年」的惨剧。但当她伙同烈问寒的古怪小师叔上天下地惹是生非时，三太子鳌龙却带著水世界里与她订了亲的未婚夫前来找寻──天哪，三个男人，翩翩这下可忙个不停，任她再有通天本领，也无法清洁简单朴素迅速确实地断下决定……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34496", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2188681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188699.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188700.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2188704.html", "available": false}